    "id": "ktg-mcq-346",
    "questionNumber": 346,
    "question": "Two moles of an ideal monoatomic gas at $T_1 = 300\\text{ K}$ are mixed with three moles of an ideal rigid diatomic gas at $T_2 = 400\\text{ K}$ in an insulated rigid container. What is the final equilibrium temperature of the mixture?",
